  Following are termcap entries for the Volker-Craig Cops-10
terminal, Wyse Corp. Wyse-100 terminal, and the Intertec 
Superbrain II desktop computer running under the gscom terminal
emulator.  Note that any emulator that doesn't trap critical control
characters should work with the Superbrain termcap.

  I don't claim to be a termcap wizard, or that these are
the definitive entries, but they work for me.

-- Rex
